# Plan naming

When creating or renaming plans in `.cursor/plans/`:

- **Filename:** Use 1–3 words, lowercase, hyphenated (e.g. `poll-page.plan.md`, `responsive-design.plan.md`, `login-signup.plan.md`). No long descriptive phrases or IDs in the filename.
- **Frontmatter `name`:** Use 1–3 words for the plan’s display name (e.g. `name: Poll page`, `name: Responsive design`, `name: Login signup`).

Avoid: `poll_page_default_view_vote_f0d762ff.plan.md`, `linkup_responsive_design_3dc508ce.plan.md`.  
Prefer: `poll-page.plan.md`, `responsive-design.plan.md`.
